{
  "slug": "counsel-frameworks",
  "name": "Counsel Frameworks",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Psychological Framework Learning Tool — meta-router for 14 counseling frameworks: CBT, ACT, SFBT, Motivational Interviewing, IFS, Narrative Therapy, MBSR, MBCT, Positive Psychotherapy, REBT, Gottman Method (couples), DBT Skills, Worden's Grief, Person-Centered Therapy. For self-reflection and learning ONLY. Not a replacement for professional psychotherapy. Invoke /counsel.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `act` (Acceptance and Commitment Therapy (Steven Hayes) - Develop psychological flexibility through acceptance, defusion, values, and committed action), `cbt` (Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (Aaron Beck) - Identify and restructure unhelpful thinking patterns through the thoughts-feelings-behaviors triangle), `counsel` (Psychological Framework Learning Tool — a meta-router that automatically selects the optimal combination from 14 counseling frameworks to…), `dbt-skills` (DBT Skills Training (Linehan) — Four modules of skills for emotional regulation and interpersonal effectiveness: Mindfulness, Distress Tolerance,…), `gottman` (Gottman Method (as described by Drs), `ifs` (Internal Family Systems (Richard Schwartz) - Access the Self to heal and harmonize your inner system of parts), `mbct` (Mindfulness-Based Cognitive Therapy (Segal, Williams, Teasdale) - Prevent depressive relapse through mindfulness and decentering from negative thought patterns), `mbsr` (Mindfulness-Based Stress Reduction (Jon Kabat-Zinn) - Cultivate present-moment awareness to transform your relationship with stress, pain, and illness), and 7 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install counsel-frameworks@claude-community` from `ironyjk/counsel-frameworks`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
